---
permalink: ./ff14-reflections.html
title: 最终幻想XIV · 镜界棱镜
bodyClass: world-ff14 ff-reflections-page
pageType: ff14-reflections
worldId: ff14
cssFiles:
  - base.css
  - nav.css
  - worlds.css
  - ff14-world.css
  - responsive.css
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<article class="ff-atlas" id="reflection-atlas" aria-labelledby="reflection-title">
  <header class="ff-atlas-hero">
    <a class="ff-backlink" href="./ff14.html">← ÆTHERIS / 水晶星海入口</a>
    <p class="ff-eyebrow">FOURTEEN WORLDS / REFLECTION PRISM</p>
    <h1 id="reflection-title">镜界<span>棱镜</span></h1>
    <p>原初世界与十三镜像是空间—以太结构，不是十四条平行时间线。选择晶面读取已公开记录；暗淡晶面保留未知，不用想象填空。</p>
    <div class="ff-atlas-legend">
      <span><i class="is-source"></i>原初世界</span>
      <span><i class="is-recorded"></i>已有记录</span>
      <span><i class="is-quiet"></i>未建立独立档案</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="ff-reflection-layout">
    <div class="ff-prism-map" role="group" aria-label="十四世界星盘">
      <div class="ff-prism-orbit ff-prism-orbit--outer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="ff-prism-orbit ff-prism-orbit--inner" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="ff-prism-axis" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      {% for reflection in ff14Catalog.reflections %}
      <button class="ff-reflection-node ff-reflection-node--{{ reflection.tone }}{% if loop.first %} is-active{% endif %}"
        type="button"
        data-reflection-id="{{ reflection.id }}"
        aria-pressed="{% if loop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
        aria-controls="{{ reflection.id }}">
        <span>{{ reflection.code }}</span>
        <strong>{{ reflection.name }}</strong>
        <i></i>
      </button>
      {% endfor %}
      <div class="ff-prism-caption" aria-hidden="true"><span>THE SUNDERING</span><i></i><span>NOT TO SCALE</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="ff-reflection-panels" aria-live="polite">
      {% for reflection in ff14Catalog.reflections %}
      <section class="ff-reflection-panel ff-reflection-panel--{{ reflection.tone }}"
        id="{{ reflection.id }}"
        data-reflection-panel="{{ reflection.id }}"
        {% if not loop.first %}hidden{% endif %}>
        <header>
          <span>{% if reflection.id === 'source' %}SOURCE / ORIGIN{% else %}REFLECTION / {{ reflection.code }}{% endif %}</span>
          <i>{{ reflection.status }}</i>
          <h2>{{ reflection.name }}</h2>
          {% if reflection.latin %}<small>{{ reflection.latin }}</small>{% endif %}
        </header>
        <p>{{ reflection.summary }}</p>
        <div class="ff-reflection-records">
          {% if reflection.records.length %}
          <span>CANONICAL RECORDS / {{ reflection.records.length }}</span>
          {% for record in reflection.records %}
          <a href="./ff14-chronicle.html#{{ record.id }}"><time>{{ record.dateDisplay }}</time><strong>{{ record.title }}</strong><i>→</i></a>
          {% endfor %}
          {% else %}
          <div class="ff-quiet-record"><i></i><strong>NO PUBLIC INDEX</strong><p>保持暗面，直到资料来源、编号语义和剧透边界可以同时说明。</p></div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <footer>
          {% for source in reflection.sources %}<a href="{{ source.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">来源 / {{ source.title }} ↗</a>{% endfor %}
        </footer>
      </section>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside class="ff-model-rule">
    <strong>MODEL BOUNDARY</strong>
    <p>第八灵灾相关未来属于时间分支；天外文明属于星海航路；Vana’diel 属于联动外部世界。三者都不占用镜像世界编号。</p>
    <a href="https://na.finalfantasyxiv.com/lodestone/topics/detail/97a2a4790be2d450e2737f8a53e8d0ce19fc122d" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">页面级设定参考 / Encyclopædia Eorzea III ↗</a>
  </aside>
</article>
<noscript><style>.world-ff14 .ff-prism-map{display:none!important}.world-ff14 .ff-reflection-layout{display:block!important}.world-ff14 .ff-reflection-panel[hidden]{display:block!important}.world-ff14 .ff-reflection-panels{max-height:none!important;overflow:visible!important}</style></noscript>
{% endblock %}
